# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored — it pins exact provider
# versions/checksums and must be committed, the same way a lockfile for any
# other package manager would be.

# Local dev secrets (already in use this session, e.g. HR Dashboard app/.env)
.env
